  "ctGuessBy with decapsulation access (brief)": "PqxdhDeploymentIdealAnomalyGuesser.ctGuessByCca (KEMScheme.IND_CCA_preChallengeImpl of the selected secret key, the phase-1 interface of PqxdhKemIndCca.OneKeyAdversary); ctGuessByCca_ambient relates it to the frozen PqxdhDeploymentIdealAnomaly.ctGuessBy",
  "anomalyGuesser (plan section 84)": "PqxdhDeploymentIdealAnomalyGuesser.anomalyGuesser : MlKem768PublicKey -> OracleComp (MlKemCCAOracleSpec baseSpec) (Option MlKem768Ciphertext)",
